    "detailed_description": "<h1>Deal With The Devil</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988600/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1667444498\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988600/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1667444498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988600/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1667444498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></p><br><h1>YOU MAY ALSO LIKE</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988600/extras/8db00e5e57a3b4b21828b58091eb3e1a.avif?t=1667444498\" /></div><br><strong>In The Devil's Chosen, classic action, tense exploration, puzzle-solving gameplay and the worst demons you can imagine in a classic card world style.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988600/extras/40016238bf327606e3415cb60e57da29.avif?t=1667444498\" /></div><br>Players team up with an unnamed character, because that's not important, and his pathetic attempt to have a girlfriend, which he sometimes doesn't understand, how she always gets him into trouble, today was no different, the fate of hell it's in your hands!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988600/extras/9de80f675ef2bc91cc0f5622d61a703a.avif?t=1667444498\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>A whole new perspective</strong> \u2013 Have you ever seen anything like this? All handmade. Cards?<br></li><li><strong>Terribly realistic visuals</strong> \u2013 The sickest monsters ever seen by mammals.<br></li><li><strong>Face the grotesque hordes</strong> \u2013 Demons will run after you as they react in real time, taking instant visible damage, making every bullet count.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988600/extras/f2a0fd71a9f775e94f2755702271c2ea.avif?t=1667444498\" /></div><br></li><li><strong>Iconic Gameplay </strong> \u2013 Engage in frantic combat with enemies, explore menacing dark corridors, solve puzzles to access areas and collect and use items discovered around the environment in a constant and terrifying fight for survival.<br></li><li><strong>See your favorite characters under your survivors collection</strong> - Today you try to be the hero, and help the gang!<br></li><li>Take the role of the Demon Destroyer - Find new weapons, places, enemies, friends, and a whole lot of ugly stuff. </li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988600/extras/fbec107f91a8ad8a4bc43b5ee6dfd5be.avif?t=1667444498\" /></div><br><strong>Time to get ready and *%@&amp;* everything!!!!!!!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1988600/extras/8741160f36f1b359b1116c841919738c.avif?t=1667444498\" /></div>",
